# Welcome to Waraki

If you have music files stored on this device that you would like to play, or host for playing elsewhere, then you can set up a music library by telling Waraki where your music files are.
[set up new music library] 

If you have already set up a music library, you can connect to it
[connect to music library]


——


# Set up new music library

Please select where your music files are stored on your device. Waraki will search this directory and all sub-directories for any mp3, m4a, ogg, or flac files.

[Files]({id = “musicDirFileBrowser”})



[cancel]({id = “cancelButton”}) [ok]({id = “okButton”})

—

# Searching..

If you have an IP address or url where your Waraki music library is hosted, you can enter it here to connect directly.

[]({id = “ipTextEntry”})
[connect]({id = “connectButton”})


[cancel]({id = “cancelButton”})